{"product":{"id":8082800115790,"title":"Nusuk Essentials Discovery Set","body_html":"\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThis set brings together three distinctive Nusuk creations — a dark spicy oud, a crisp citrus-aquatic freshie, and a rich rose-oud signature. Three miniatures that showcase the diverse character of Nusuk, from effortless freshness to deep Middle Eastern warmth.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eInside:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e• \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAgar Noir Intense Parfum\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e is chestnut, cognac, saffron, and labdanum over sage, cinnamon, and birch tar, settling into smoke, praline, sandalwood, and oud — smoky, warm, and intensely captivating.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e• \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSama\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e is lemon and bergamot over ozonic notes, sage, and geranium, settling into moss, musk, and mineral amber — fresh, airy, and effortlessly clean.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e• \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAl Mukhtalif Signature\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e is oud, rose, sandalwood, amber, bergamot, neroli, and jasmine over agarwood, patchouli, cedar, lemon, and rose, settling into oud, musk, and vanilla — rich, woody, and luxuriously smooth.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThree Nusuk essentials, one exceptional set — the perfect way to experience three distinctive sides of the house.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"Scentira","product_type":"Bundle","created_at":"2026-09-19T13:08:56+05:30","handle":"nusuk-essentials-sa